#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The B<strlen()> function calculates the length of the string I<s>, not "
#| "including the terminating `\\e0' character."
msgid ""
"The B<strlen>()  function calculates the length of the string pointed to by "
"I<s>, excluding the terminating null byte (\\[aq]\\[rs]0\\[aq])."
msgstr ""
"La función B<strlen()> calcula la longitud de la cadena de caracteres I<s>, "
"sin incluir el carácter terminador `\\e0'."

