#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The B<strlen()> function returns the number of characters in I<s>."
msgid ""
"The B<strlen>()  function returns the number of bytes in the string pointed "
"to by I<s>."
msgstr "La función B<strlen()> devuelve el número de caracteres en I<s>."

